  <h3>Sumo Royal</h3>
  <p>This game was a assignment from a game design class at the university in Chicoutimi (Canada). Me and my team had to include a chess board and a deck of cards to create a game that contained some “emergent” gameplay, where the mechanics create a whole that is more interesting that the individual parts. It should have a simple set of base rules, but which create a gameplay that is very deep and has lots of strategy and player decisions.</p>
  <img
