  <h3>Queen’s Race</h3>
  <p>This was a game that I created with a team for the game design class at the university of Chicoutimi (Canada). We had to create a game that included a deck of cards and only easily accessible items such as dice or tokens. We also had to include the queen of hearts and the 3 of spades in the rules as part of the victory condition.</p>
  <img
    src="/images/paper-prototypes/09.webp"
    alt="Prototypes and GGDs image 9"
    width="1920"
    height="2484"
    class="w-full"
  />
  <img
    src="/images/paper-prototypes/10.webp"
    alt="Prototypes and GGDs image 10"
    width="1920"
    height="2484"
    class="w-full"
  />
  <h3>Mythled GDD</h3>
  <p>Both of these documents are GDDs that my team wrote for the “Mythled” project. The first is the one I created, when we were brainstorming at the beginning of the project and each of us had to propose a game idea and present it to the group with a GDD.</p>
